{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3b9a2333cdf237d9d5fd4084e2c58bd3c01b91bdc9cdbb97fca5371e693eda8e", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の一環で、スーパーに\nやってきた。やよいは地元特産の人参をPRする）", "zh": "（作为角色扮演写真企划的一环，来到了超市。弥生要为当地特产胡萝卜进行宣传）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "a49fd1a10f514c98ecb26c474548c1c142b31ccc50f60025176ba617ef941761", "ja": "{$P$}！　今日は、たくさんの人に\nニンジンの料理を作っちゃいまーす！", "zh": "{$P$}！今天要给很多人做胡萝卜料理啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8d1f40928034523dc23d1aa5a983776f2647c302a08b9bcf2931ad1669d89729", "ja": "ああ。人参の魅力をアピールするのが目的だからね。\n試食っていうのはいいアイデアだよな。", "zh": "啊。我们的目的是宣传胡萝卜的魅力嘛。\n做试吃品是个好主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3d42f28cd62c1c2771c1b02b002851f1958c83f7be30922a8be7edf53ec5917a", "ja": "そういえば、試食用の料理は\nやよいが提案したって聞いたけど……。", "zh": "说起来，我听说试吃用的料理是弥生提议的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "ddfb2740c7bd13501a756d0baf898306cc2c72fdbf9a1ff190afc69d0bf8c631", "ja": "はい！　ニンジンだけの料理も考えたんですけど、\nせっかくなら、もやしと一緒にどうかなーって。", "zh": "是的！我也想过只用胡萝卜做的料理，不过难得有这个机会，要不要和豆芽一起做呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4dd5580861655fb54b7677d2e41b4df5e58c2b95048e5d8960168a8c68d96031", "ja": "もやしと？", "zh": "和豆芽一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "5a2ee23a17c0b8ed3e107436ef42d205289d168c22bacfac8e0b87d6b3ebc4fb", "ja": "{$P$}、もやしをバカにしちゃダメ\nです！　ニンジンと、すっごく相性がいいんですよ！", "zh": "{$P$}，可不能小看豆芽！\n它和胡萝卜特别搭呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "4255465950f0b4cfa3476f8db0051421bf82ba1704d31151c28192cebcecf725", "ja": "炒めてもいいし、和えてもいいんです。もやしは\n栄養があって、お得で、いっぱい食べられて……。", "zh": "炒着吃也行，拌着吃也行。豆芽既有营养，又实惠，还能吃很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5b3206e6141812bb52d8dcb1873afce7da503d7dbc2a58f5434997fbc46ac108", "ja": "ごめんごめん！　バカにしたわけじゃないんだ。\nうん、オレンジと白色の取り合わせがいいかもな。", "zh": "对不起对不起！我不是要小看你。\n嗯，橙色和白色搭配在一起，或许很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "83a85917fc560635679a56789df1b8fa38ccf89fb7ddf3e6cac86bd40fe832f0", "ja": "えへへ♪　美味しそうな見た目も大事ですよね！\n私、お買い物に行くと、いつも試食しちゃうんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 看起来好不好吃也很重要呢！\n我去买东西的时候，总是会忍不住试吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "6215e536746e4abe9b7330c2c4d5461ed6368fae3be6146e6c8818be6153ad3f", "ja": "ジュージューって音とか、おいしそうな匂いとか\n気になって……。だから他の人もおんなじかなーって。", "zh": "滋滋作响的声音，还有诱人的香味，\n总会让人在意……所以我就在想，其他人是不是也一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cc7f160c85b7e4b2d133322bb4c19817ef3a236a7d8a42f9c9a14028f983f809", "ja": "確かに……。お腹が空いてると、特にな。もやしと\n一緒だとボリューム感も増すし……うん、いいと思う！", "zh": "确实……。肚子饿的时候，尤其明显。加上豆芽的话分量感也会增加……嗯，我觉得不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "64dd495ef1188a25457f0f184944506212912335b092a7e33e5c11b192a369ff", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}の\nお墨付きもらっちゃいましたー！", "zh": "呜～呜～！得到了{$P$}的\n保证呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "2c2d0bd52585b45df60330e0bcba2b098306fb99dd1760f2d42318ffee71b543", "ja": "農家の人が頑張って育てた立派なお野菜ですから。\nみなさんの気持ち、私がたくさんの人に届けますね！", "zh": "这是农家人辛苦培育出来的优秀蔬菜。\n我会把大家的心意传递给更多人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a063872d07a8615b5de21a13f55a0d1dff64c3f483a3aba0b5aa403991cbd669", "ja": "そうだな。\n多くの人に手にとってもらえるように、頑張ろう！", "zh": "是啊。为了让更多人愿意拿在手里，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "94e161c33ed9f73c67199c7689992a8c20f26622a3a0235bd3e28ced2100398e", "ja": "はーい、任せてください！　もやしを使った料理には\n自信があるんです！　えへへ♪", "zh": "好——！交给我吧！我对用豆芽做的料理很有自信！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1016_se", "source_sha256": "bc9dce78a339d2483784a66783933075ae9b3d3d3d6f3ccef7cae79d16d2f3f4", "ja": "ジュ～～～！", "zh": "啾～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "f696c7375dc81ba8104ca34c6fe5231fdec384a8a9d3e606f6db5cfca36232e7", "ja": "甘くておいしいニンジンですよー……はわっ！？\nじゅ、順番に！　みなさん、順番に並んでくださいー！", "zh": "这是又甜又好吃的胡萝卜哦——……呀！？\n请、请按顺序！大家，请按顺序排队——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0453_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6fafb9e1677c51a623d08babfeacac2ab46947e6a9c4f8128693426e43c73199", "ja": "（やよいの作戦は大成功！　……だが、人が殺到して\nちょっとしたイベントのようになってしまった）", "zh": "（弥生的作战大获成功！……不过人们蜂拥而至，结果变成了个小型活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
